  "language": "en",
  "_readme": [
    "Vocabulary lives in 'pools' and 'bossPools'. Nothing else in the game",
    "hardcodes a word. To add vocabulary, drop it in the pool whose length",
    "band it belongs to -- no code change is needed.",
    "",
    "'difficulties' is the tuning table: for each tier, a list of level bands",
    "saying which pools that stretch of the run may draw from and which boss",
    "pool its bosses use. Bands are matched by 'throughLevel' in order, and the",
    "last band also covers every level beyond it. Making an early level easier",
    "is an edit here, not in Java.",
    "",
    "Pool length bands: tiny 2-3, short 4-5, medium 6-7, long 8-10, epic 11+.",
    "Boss ranks:        novice 5-7, adept 8-10, master 11-13, legend 14+."
